   "description": "**Builds the model, loads collections and tasks, records the settings, and trains**\n\nThe model is seeded; collections are decoded or read from the cache; `inputs_for` gives the photo input for the encoder. The settings dict is what config.json holds beside the training settings: the model and task settings, the TabICL checkpoint name, the collection names and their sha256."
